Map each to 1-3 skills in the registry so Option 3 injection picks them up.

## 8. Verification Plan

**Manual**: (a) Trigger `send-email` skill, ask agent to guide; verify image IDs appear in logs, image renders in side panel. (b) Force an invalid `image_id` via a test fixture; confirm step still renders text, warn logged. (c) Delete a file from disk; confirm figure hides cleanly.

